<p>Two components, one vocabulary: <code>im-syllabus</code> is the curriculum on the course page, <code>im-coursenav</code> the list in the lesson player. The same numerals and the same state marks — tick, play, lock, a ring for free — so a student learns them once; what differs is the job. The syllabus is wide, says a line about every lesson and sells; the coursenav is narrow, terse and gets you to the next one.</p>

<h2>The syllabus, on the course page</h2>
<p><code>components/syllabus</code>: the head sums the course up and shows progress once started; every unit is a card with its numeral, a line about it and its meta; every lesson is a row with the state mark, a still wearing its length, the number and title, one line about it, what it is and what comes with it, a preview button when it is free, and the state on the right. Wide and descriptive, because this page sells.</p>
{{#example}}
{{> "components/syllabus" units=demo.sections lessons="7" minutes="81" free="2" done="2" total="7" percent="29" value=".29"}}
{{/example}}

<h2>The rail, on the lesson page</h2>
<p><code>components/coursenav</code>: the same states as marks, a still per row or without (<code>im-coursenav-plain</code>), and "next up" pinned to the foot. In the player it sits flush in the fixed side; here it is a card.</p>
{{#example}}
<div class="im-grid-auto im-grid-lg im-grid-start">
	<nav class="im-coursenav" aria-label="Lessons">
		<div class="im-coursenav-head"><p class="im-coursenav-title">{{icon "graduation-cap"}}Design tokens, properly</p><p class="im-coursenav-progress"><span>2 of 7 done</span><span>29%</span><span class="im-progress" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="29" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" style="--im-value: .29"></span></p></div>
		<div class="im-coursenav-body">{{#each demo.sections}}{{#match @index "<" 2}}<details class="im-coursenav-unit" open><summary><b>{{n}}</b><span>{{name}}</span><small>{{time}}</small></summary>{{#each ../demo.lessons}}{{#match n ">=" ../from}}{{#match n "<=" ../to}}<a class="im-coursenav-lesson" href="#" data-state="{{#if locked}}locked{{else}}{{state}}{{/if}}"{{#match state "=" "current"}} aria-current="page"{{/match}}><span class="im-coursenav-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="im-coursenav-shot"><img src="{{lookup @root.demo.shots shot}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span>{{title}}</span><small>{{time}}</small></a>{{/match}}{{/match}}{{/each}}</details>{{/match}}{{/each}}</div>
	</nav>
	<nav class="im-coursenav im-coursenav-plain" aria-label="Lessons, plain">
		<div class="im-coursenav-head"><p class="im-coursenav-title">{{icon "graduation-cap"}}Without stills</p></div>
		<div class="im-coursenav-body">{{#each demo.sections}}{{#match @index "<" 2}}<details class="im-coursenav-unit" open><summary><b>{{n}}</b><span>{{name}}</span><small>{{time}}</small></summary>{{#each ../demo.lessons}}{{#match n ">=" ../from}}{{#match n "<=" ../to}}<a class="im-coursenav-lesson" href="#" data-state="{{#if locked}}locked{{else}}{{state}}{{/if}}"{{#match state "=" "current"}} aria-current="page"{{/match}}><span class="im-coursenav-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>{{title}}</span><small>{{time}}</small></a>{{/match}}{{/match}}{{/each}}</details>{{/match}}{{/each}}</div>
	</nav>
</div>
{{/example}}
